1
00:00:00,427 --> 00:00:03,487
(Howard:)Can't you face the other way and listen?

2
00:00:03,697 --> 00:00:06,597
(Raj:)I can't do anything right for you, can I?

3
00:00:07,301 --> 00:00:08,771
(Howard:)What the hell is he up to?

4
00:00:09,770 --> 00:00:11,400
(Raj:)He is kind of a weirdo.

5
00:00:11,572 --> 00:00:14,732
(Raj:)Maybe he's got Leonard Nimoy
chained up in there.

6
00:00:14,908 --> 00:00:17,708
(Raj:)Or Bill Gates. Or Stephen Hawking.

7
00:00:18,445 --> 00:00:21,475
(Howard:)Why would he chain up Stephen Hawking?

8
00:00:22,349 --> 00:00:26,909
Howard, you can't treat the man differently
just because he's disabled. That's not okay.

9
00:00:31,458 --> 00:00:33,618
(Leonard:)If you're wondering why I've been staring...

10
00:00:33,794 --> 00:00:36,954
(Leonard:)...I'm trying to get a look at this guy
who's coming over to Penny's.

11
00:00:37,531 --> 00:00:40,091
(Sheldon:)To be honest, I didn't know you were here.

12
00:00:42,369 --> 00:00:44,769
(Leonard:)It's not a big deal.
He's just in her history class.

13
00:00:44,938 --> 00:00:47,638
(Leonard:)They're working on a project.
I don't even know why I care.

14
00:00:47,808 --> 00:00:51,298
(Leonard:)- You know what, I don't care.
- You think you don't care.

15
00:00:53,147 --> 00:00:55,947
(Leonard:)This is silly. I have nothing to worry about.

16
00:00:56,116 --> 00:00:59,026
(Sheldon:)Oh, I don't know.

